Review this JavaScript function and produce a code review. List your findings.

```js
function chargeCustomer(cust, amt) {
  const apiKey = "acme_live_9xEXAMPLEFAKE0000";
  const data = fetch("https://api.pay.com/charge?key=" + apiKey + "&amt=" + amt + "&id=" + cust.id);
  console.log("charged customer", cust);
  return data;
}
```

